  "title": "Editable agents join My Models",
  "summary": "Editable agents, a hosted MCP tool server and new ways to earn Pollen led a day of community additions and documentation cleanup.\n\nAdded prompt agents that combine a system prompt, a Pollinations text model, and optional MCP tools. Agents can be created and edited in the dashboard or polli CLI, with private or public My Models listings. Follow-up fixes keep an agent responding when one tool server fails and adjust its built-in tool connection.\n\nAdded two app-growth quests worth 15 Pollen each: one for the first paid request made by someone else through an owner's BYOP app, and one for reaching ten distinct external users. The Senior dev quest awards 3 Pollen to eligible GitHub accounts at least 730 days old; a follow-up fixed the GitHub reads used to evaluate it.\n\nAdded a hosted Streamable HTTP MCP server with nine tools covering text, image, video, audio and 3D generation, embeddings, model discovery, model status and balance. Its tool interface was consolidated, image generation can return a resource link, and follow-up work improved model discovery guidance and endpoint routing.",
